## Source file header

Every C#, JavaScript, and PowerShell source file in this repository begins with the following
attribution header:

```text
//
// Copyright (c) Jeninnet.
// Part of the Jeninnet Platform.
// Repository: https://github.com/TarekNajem04/Jeninnet.Validation
// Licensed under the MIT License.
//
```

PowerShell files use the same header with `#` comment markers. This header is part of the
copyright and license notice for the Software and must remain in all copies, modifications,
and substantial portions of the Software. Do not remove, replace, or hide it when copying
code into another project or package; keep the copyright and MIT license notice intact.
